## SQL 2

> 代码位置：`ControlWarningRuleServiceImpl.execute()` 调用 `getComplianceList()` 中的合规名单查询。用途：查询 VirtualCard 模式下的有效合规引擎账户，并标记其名单类型。

```sql
SELECT
    "account"."id" "accountId",
    COALESCE("complianceEngine"."type",'NormalList') "type"
FROM "complianceEngine"
    LEFT JOIN "account" On "complianceEngine"."accountId"::UUID=account."id"
WHERE "complianceEngine"."deleteTime" IS NULL
  AND "account"."deleteTime" IS NULL
  AND "complianceEngine"."isClear"='false'
  AND "complianceEngine"."status"='Active'
  AND "account"."status"='Active'
  AND "complianceEngine"."model"='VirtualCard'
  AND ("referralCodeId" !='32778105-f4a6-463d-a5f0-2a35b6a07c6c' or "referralCodeId" is null)
  AND "parentAccountId" !='71d089f9-87df-4de3-8e19-b8a6dc81d224'
limit 10;
```

## SQL 3

> 代码位置：`ControlWarningRuleServiceImpl.execute()` 调用 `getComplianceList()` 中的普通账户查询。用途：查询通过 KYC、但尚未配置有效合规引擎的普通账户。

```sql
SELECT
    "account"."id" "accountId",
    'NormalList' as "type"
FROM "account"
    LEFT JOIN "accountExtend" ON "account".id="accountExtend"."accountId"::UUID
WHERE "account"."deleteTime" IS NULL
  AND "account"."status"='Active'
  AND "accountExtend"."kycStatus"='Passed'
  AND ("referralCodeId" !='32778105-f4a6-463d-a5f0-2a35b6a07c6c' or "referralCodeId" is null)
  AND "parentAccountId" !='71d089f9-87df-4de3-8e19-b8a6dc81d224'
  AND "account"."id" not in( select "accountId" from "complianceEngine" where "deleteTime" IS NULL and "isClear"='false' and "status"='Active' and "model"='VirtualCard')
limit 10;
```

