## SQL 14：daysSinceLastTransaction（根据 Mapper 重建）

> 代码位置：`QbitCardLabelServiceImpl.fetchDaysSinceLastTransaction()` 调用 `OdsLabelTransactionMapper.getDaysSinceLastTransaction()`。用途：计算每个账户距离最近一笔交易的天数，查询结果映射到 `daysSinceLastTransaction`，无结果时 Java 默认值为 181。

> 性能备注：当前 SQL 查询约 2 秒；增加 `"createTime"` 分区范围后约 0.3 秒。建议保留最近交易时间计算逻辑，同时补充 `"createTime"` 范围以触发分区裁剪。

```sql
SELECT
    "accountId",
    COALESCE(
        EXTRACT(
            DAY FROM AGE(
                CURRENT_DATE,
                MAX(GREATEST("completeTime", "transactionTime"))
            )
        ),
        0
    ) AS "daysSinceLastTransaction"
FROM "qbit_card_transaction" AS q
WHERE "deleteTime" IS NULL
  AND "accountId"::UUID IN (
      'a9cda2aa-92c6-4f98-ae58-a2e01ecae10b',
      '4d0a940c-48c8-4571-8869-8a9a5ab0b13f',
      '09837659-6b48-4de5-9368-97686d747564',
      '4119aa0f-c4db-40f6-8dc0-af0f4ba66d23',
      '5044e827-f811-4611-8403-38cd1fe74120'
  )
  AND "completeTime" >= '2026-03-10 00:00:00'
  AND "completeTime" <= '2026-09-07 00:00:00'
GROUP BY "accountId";
```

